From 9bdb698dd0f553bdcf497c38a7181cee09a04ca8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 09:03:51 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 02/29] inkling2: fp8 global KV, NVFP4 drafter weights and a
 profile mode as recipe switches

The release build's levers, back as registered settings, all off by default:
TF_INKLING2_KV=fp8 keeps the global layers' K/V as e4m3 with an fp32 scale a token and key head (decode, fold
and prompt kernels read it bit for bit like the bf16 path), TF_INKLING2_DRAFT_WEIGHTS=nvfp4 quantises the
drafter's projections at load, and TF_INKLING2_PROFILE=1 logs a round's phase times on each rank. The engine
tool gains a timing mode.
